From 35a57a21360424de71813dd6af7524c956211853 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OpenWorlds <openworlds@localhost>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 14:44:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 16/18] java.io.File as the JDK's

Normalized paths, relative ones resolved against user.dir, absolute and
canonical paths, equals/hashCode/compareTo by path, toString the path,
lastModified in milliseconds, isFile, renameTo, createNewFile, mkdirs,
setLastModified, permissions, space, list with filters, toURI, toPath.
On the Vita a device prefix (ux0:) starts an absolute path. File streams
open the absolute path; FileOutputStream(FileDescriptor) writes to the
process output.
